{"5140770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Needle In a Haystack", "steam_appid": 5140770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hay has been piling up in this old barn for far too long. Somewhere beneath all of it, <strong>a tiny needle</strong> is waiting to be found. There’s only one way to get to it: start clearing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t have to do everything by hand forever. Pick up a <strong>rake</strong> or unlock <strong>more powerful tools</strong> capable of clearing huge amounts of hay at once.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, every handful counts. But as you <strong>upgrade your tools</strong> and improve the way you work, mountains of hay that once seemed endless will start disappearing faster and faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t let all that hay go to waste. Gather it up, feed it into the <strong>baling machine</strong>, load the finished bales onto your <strong>truck</strong>, and sell them for <strong>money</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you earn to unlock new equipment and upgrades, then head back into the barn even better prepared than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, the barn gets cleaner. New corners are uncovered, piles disappear, and the impossible starts to feel a little more possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>After all, the needle has to be in there somewhere...</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hay has been piling up in this old barn for far too long. Somewhere beneath all of it, <strong>a tiny needle</strong> is waiting to be found. There’s only one way to get to it: start clearing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/8b5b926f5b05ebcc543b82724cb6da31.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t have to do everything by hand forever. Pick up a <strong>rake</strong> or unlock <strong>more powerful tools</strong> capable of clearing huge amounts of hay at once.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/b25493d24672aba47b84d602e0bf8611.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, every handful counts. But as you <strong>upgrade your tools</strong> and improve the way you work, mountains of hay that once seemed endless will start disappearing faster and faster.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/1fe9aa2b6f4910679741bcef0159b2d3.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t let all that hay go to waste. Gather it up, feed it into the <strong>baling machine</strong>, load the finished bales onto your <strong>truck</strong>, and sell them for <strong>money</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.poster.avif?t=1787945847\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.webm?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/extras/ace6670fe8b5364c3f5000386811a6ac.mp4?t=1787945847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you earn to unlock new equipment and upgrades, then head back into the barn even better prepared than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, the barn gets cleaner. New corners are uncovered, piles disappear, and the impossible starts to feel a little more possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>After all, the needle has to be in there somewhere...</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "They say finding a needle in a haystack is impossible. Time to prove them wrong. Clear millions of pieces of hay from an old barn, upgrade your tools, sell what you collect, and search every last pile until that tiny needle finally shows itself.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/972134077a447a998ceba39364642458dba15373/header.jpg?t=1787945847", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/63279fc5cebd62ca7b7c3481cc380d1e1fe6e5aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787945847", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/63279fc5cebd62ca7b7c3481cc380d1e1fe6e5aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787945847", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Rebel Pickle Games"], "publishers": ["Rebel Pickle Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/0c858878c5803b66a84af59414c6098b9b4e1afe/ss_0c858878c5803b66a84af59414c6098b9b4e1afe.600x338.jpg?t=1787945847", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5140770/0c858878c5803b66a84af59414c6098b9b4e1afe/ss_0c858878c5803b66a84af59414c6098b9b4e1afe.1920x1080.jpg?